{{ h3 }}Core Pillars of Modern School Apps{{ /h3 }}
An all-in-one school management system connects four vital stakeholders: administrators, teachers, students, and parents.

{{ bullet }}Live Attendance Tracking with automated notifications for parents{{ /bullet }}
{{ bullet }}Integrated Online Admissions with document uploads and instant receipt generation{{ /bullet }}
{{ bullet }}Direct WhatsApp & Push Notifications for emergency announcements and exam timetables{{ /bullet }}
{{ bullet }}DPDP Act 2023 Compliant privacy architectures protecting student information{{ /bullet }}

